{"id":5782096745,"name":"Wall Hop Frenzy [Practice]","desc":"😎 Play this game all the way through to be the BEST WALL HOP PRO in ROBLOX!\n\n🔴 What's a Wall Hop? A wall hop is a glitch used to get an extra jump by jumping and turning on a wall stacked on top of each other!\n\n🏃 118 Unique Stages!\n🌎 Explore 7 Different Difficulties!\n👆 Select any Stage!\n🔒 Unlock Difficulties!\n💪 Become a Wall Hop Pro!\n\n⚠️💻 Setting your FPS to 60 is required to wall hop! (FPS can be accessed in the in-game roblox menu)\n\nTONS of exciting wallhop stages ranging from easy to hard difficulty. Each stage you beat helps you become better at wall hopping. Wall Hop Frenzy is like a Difficulty Chart Obby, only you can select your stages within your difficulty. If you are stuck you can come back. If you are a skilled wall hop player you can try the harder stages in the game!\n\n👍 We have tons of feedback saying this game has helped players become a pro wall hopper!\n\nPlease ⭐/👍 to help support the game!","path":"/game/5782096745-wall-hop-frenzy","slug":"5782096745-wall-hop-frenzy","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/778469b2bf1bf33f5f413fb3d5338d99d39951e2bb49fe465edfc51c261d8486.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2006cc36b47f56b754ee2377dd86ea43/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":5,"visitor":10131168,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-10T02:38:09.402Z","creator":{"name":"Foolzy","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Universal-Script-ROHUB-BY-ROCTA-127954","_id":"69a7525035f7c0d56d97657f","title":"ROHUB BY ROCTA","game":{"_id":"6959526c0597a5542a8de666","gameId":0,"name":"Script hub","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"ROHUB","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/erafonexyz1-dot